      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::003::main"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sliding will activate the additive and drive its segregation to the contact surface.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::003::main"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The activated additive will form a thin, adherent, nanocrystalline or amorphous tribofilm.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tribofilm will mitigate direct metal-to-metal contact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tribofilm will stabilize friction-induced dynamic grain refinement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will counter inverse Hall–Petch softening at low loads.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will counter deleterious oxide-layer cracking at high temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will have a coefficient of friction near or below 0.2.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::003::main"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
